		<div id="sp-page-builder" class="sp-page-builder  page-8 " x-data="easystoreProductList">

	
	

	
	<div class="page-content builder-container" x-data="easystoreProductDetails">

				<section id="section-id-1532355780541" class="sppb-section sppb-hidden-sm sppb-hidden-xs" ><div class="sppb-row-container"><div class="sppb-row"><div class="sppb-col-md-12  " id="column-wrap-id-1532355780540"><div id="column-id-1532355780540" class="sppb-column " ><div class="sppb-column-addons"><div id="sppb-addon-wrapper-1532355780544" class="sppb-addon-wrapper  addon-root-heading"><div id="sppb-addon-1532355780544" class="clearfix  "     ><div class="sppb-addon sppb-addon-header"><h1 class="sppb-addon-title">Welkom in the Inkijkmuseum</h1></div></div></div><div id="sppb-addon-wrapper-1532356608243" class="sppb-addon-wrapper  addon-root-text-block"><div id="sppb-addon-1532356608243" class="clearfix  "     ><div class="sppb-addon sppb-addon-text-block " ><h3 class="sppb-addon-title">The smallest museum in town</h3><div class="sppb-addon-content  "><p><img style="margin-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; float: right;" src="/images/logo_zwart_240x240.jpg" alt="logo inkijkmuseum" /></p>
<p>The Inkijkmuseum is the smallest museum in town, but it hosts the probably <a href="http://www.showyourhope.net" target="_blank" rel="noopener">biggest contemporary international artcollection</a> available in the Netherlands.</p>
<p>The Inkijkmuseum is located in the old washhouse, next to the Dommel river, in the center of Eindhoven.<br />It is a location where different activities take place on micro level: Music and performances, exhibitions, artist in residence, hostel (Bed &amp; Paintings) en group-accommodation, it can function as a micro restaurant, people live there and it it is the basis of an international operating art and theater program.</p>
<p>The Inkijkmuseum is now preparing a new phase, where the house changes into a environment. A global village with more of less coincidental guests.<br />Follow the website or <a href="http://www.facebook.com/inkijkmuseum" target="_blank" rel="noopener">facebook page</a> to stay tuned.</p></div></div></div></div><div id="section-id-1532358021512" class="sppb-section" ><div class="sppb-container-inner"><div class="sppb-row sppb-nested-row"><div class="sppb-col-md-6  " id="column-wrap-id-1532358021513"><div id="column-id-1532358021513" class="sppb-column " ><div class="sppb-column-addons"><div id="sppb-addon-wrapper-1532358021524" class="sppb-addon-wrapper  addon-root-image"><div id="sppb-addon-1532358021524" class="clearfix  "     ><div class="sppb-addon sppb-addon-single-image   sppb-addon-image-shape"><div class="sppb-addon-content"><div class="sppb-addon-single-image-container"><img  class="sppb-img-responsive " src="/images/2018/07/23/globaaldorp_scherm_sb_rood_07_540x360.jpg"  alt="Image" title="" width="" height="" /></div></div></div></div></div><div id="sppb-addon-wrapper-1532358021534" class="sppb-addon-wrapper  addon-root-image"><div id="sppb-addon-1532358021534" class="clearfix  "     ><div class="sppb-addon sppb-addon-single-image   sppb-addon-image-shape"><div class="sppb-addon-content"><div class="sppb-addon-single-image-container"><img  class="sppb-img-responsive " src="/images/2018/07/23/globaaldorp_scherm_sb_ramen_13_540x360.jpg"  alt="Image" title="" width="" height="" /></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="sppb-col-md-6  " id="column-wrap-id-1532358021516"><div id="column-id-1532358021516" class="sppb-column " ><div class="sppb-column-addons"><div id="sppb-addon-wrapper-1532358021529" class="sppb-addon-wrapper  addon-root-image"><div id="sppb-addon-1532358021529" class="clearfix  "     ><div class="sppb-addon sppb-addon-single-image   sppb-addon-image-shape"><div class="sppb-addon-content"><div class="sppb-addon-single-image-container"><img  class="sppb-img-responsive " src="/images/2018/07/23/wereldmaaltijd_540x360.jpg"  alt="Image" title="" width="" height="" /></div></div></div></div></div><div id="sppb-addon-wrapper-1532358021539" class="sppb-addon-wrapper  addon-root-image"><div id="sppb-addon-1532358021539" class="clearfix  "     ><div class="sppb-addon sppb-addon-single-image   sppb-addon-image-shape"><div class="sppb-addon-content"><div class="sppb-addon-single-image-container"><img  class="sppb-img-responsive " src="/images/2018/07/23/globaaldorp_scherm_museum_voorkant_15_540x360.jpg"  alt="Image" title="" width="" height="" /></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="section-id-1532357640446" class="sppb-section sppb-hidden-xl sppb-hidden-lg sppb-hidden-md" ><div class="sppb-row-container"><div class="sppb-row"><div class="sppb-col-md-12  " id="column-wrap-id-1532357640447"><div id="column-id-1532357640447" class="sppb-column " ><div class="sppb-column-addons"><div id="sppb-addon-wrapper-1532357640448" class="sppb-addon-wrapper  addon-root-heading"><div id="sppb-addon-1532357640448" class="clearfix  "     ><div class="sppb-addon sppb-addon-header"><h1 class="sppb-addon-title">Welkom in the Inkijkmuseum</h1></div></div></div><div id="sppb-addon-wrapper-1532359116386" class="sppb-addon-wrapper  addon-root-text-block"><div id="sppb-addon-1532359116386" class="clearfix  "     ><div class="sppb-addon sppb-addon-text-block " ><h3 class="sppb-addon-title">The smallest museum in town</h3><div class="sppb-addon-content  "><p><img style="margin-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; float: right;" src="/images/logo_zwart_240x240.jpg" alt="logo inkijkmuseum" /></p>
<p>The Inkijkmuseum is the smallest museum in town, but it hosts the probably <a href="http://www.showyourhope.net" target="_blank" rel="noopener">biggest contemporary international artcollection</a> available in the Netherlands.</p>
<p>The Inkijkmuseum is located in the old washhouse, next to the Dommel river, in the center of Eindhoven.<br />It is a location where different activities take place on micro level: Music and performances, exhibitions, artist in residence, hostel (Bed &amp; Paintings) en group-accommodation, it canfunction as micro restaurant, people live there and it it is the basis of an international operating art and theater program.</p>
<p>The inkijkmuseum is now preparing a new phase, a phase where the house changes into a environment. A global village with more of less coincidental guests.<br />Follow the website or <a href="http://www.facebook.com/inkijkmuseum" target="_blank" rel="noopener">facebook page</a> to stay tuned.</p></div></div></div></div><div id="section-id-1532358021542" class="sppb-section" ><div class="sppb-container-inner"><div class="sppb-row sppb-nested-row"><div class="sppb-col-md-6  " id="column-wrap-id-1532358021543"><div id="column-id-1532358021543" class="sppb-column " ><div class="sppb-column-addons"><div id="sppb-addon-wrapper-1532358021544" class="sppb-addon-wrapper  addon-root-image"><div id="sppb-addon-1532358021544" class="clearfix  "     ><div class="sppb-addon sppb-addon-single-image   sppb-addon-image-shape"><div class="sppb-addon-content"><div class="sppb-addon-single-image-container"><img  class="sppb-img-responsive " src="/images/2018/07/23/globaaldorp_scherm_sb_rood_07_540x360.jpg"  alt="Image" title="" width="" height="" /></div></div></div></div></div><div id="sppb-addon-wrapper-1532358021545" class="sppb-addon-wrapper  addon-root-image"><div id="sppb-addon-1532358021545" class="clearfix  "     ><div class="sppb-addon sppb-addon-single-image   sppb-addon-image-shape"><div class="sppb-addon-content"><div class="sppb-addon-single-image-container"><img  class="sppb-img-responsive " src="/images/2018/07/23/globaaldorp_scherm_sb_ramen_13_540x360.jpg"  alt="Image" title="" width="" height="" /></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="sppb-col-md-6  " id="column-wrap-id-1532358021546"><div id="column-id-1532358021546" class="sppb-column " ><div class="sppb-column-addons"><div id="sppb-addon-wrapper-1532358021547" class="sppb-addon-wrapper  addon-root-image"><div id="sppb-addon-1532358021547" class="clearfix  "     ><div class="sppb-addon sppb-addon-single-image   sppb-addon-image-shape"><div class="sppb-addon-content"><div class="sppb-addon-sing